"genre\":6007,\"chart\":\"top-paid\",\"genreShortName\":\"Productivity\",\"chartLink\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/charts/iphone/productivity-apps/6007\"}},\"supportsStreamlinedBuy\":true,\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/dumbify/id6480082872\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":3.2,\"ratingCount\":148,\"ratingCountList\":[44,12,12,24,56],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"3.2 stars\"},\"genreDisplayName\":\"Productivity\",\"name\":\"Dumbify\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"artistName\":\"AB Apps Inc.\",\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 16.0 or later.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"13.0\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Dumbify is a minimalist home screen launcher for iPhone. Dumbify helps you keep screen time down by keeping your home screen clean and clear of notifications.\\n\\nOur minimalist home screen launcher is fully customizable. Dumbify allows you to select the apps that are most important to you, and displays them in a clean minimalist launcher on your home screen.\\n\\nThe minimalist launcher for iPhone works perfectly with dark or light mode, so you can pick what looks best to you.\\n\\nThis text based minimalist launcher lets you reclaim your most valuable asset, your time!\\n\\nStop spending hours of your precious time getting distracted by your phone, and let Dumbify, a launcher exclusively for iPhone, simplify your digital life.\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.7.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Say hello to one of our biggest releases yet! :)\\n\\n- Dumbify now supports up to 3 widgets! So you can add more apps to your minimalist Home Screen without it feeling too crowded.\\n\\n- We've added a spacer widget so that you can centre your launcher widget in the middle of the screen! Along with that, we've added a setting to allow you to vertically, align your widget at the top, centre or bottom. We will be adding further customizability to the spacer widget in the near future!\\n\\n- We've updated all our tutorial videos to make them easier to understand!\\n\\n- We've made it easier for users to learn how to enable quick launch! So your apps can launch quicker with Dumbify.\\n\\n- Some users were encountering some problems when setting up dumbify, we've added some tutorials for Common Issues you may encounter.\\n\\n- General UX improvements + Bug Fixes\\n\\nWe hope that you continue to enjoy Dumbify and the minimalist, distraction free experience it provides! :)\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-06-02\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-06-02T19:54:26Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.6.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update adds some great new features! \\n- We've added the ability to set your launcher to bold, italic, bold \u0026 italic, or just keep it as normal. \\n- We've also added the ability to set your launcher to \\\"always light mode\\\", \\\"always dark mode\\\", or \\\"automatic\\\". The default is automatic and adapts to your system theme setting. \\n\\nWe've also fixed a few things that weren't working quite right. \\nThese included a potential \\\"dead zone\\\" on the widget of some versions of iOS 16, and a poorly formatted block of text.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-04-26\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-04-26T16:17:06Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.5.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Just a small update in this release:\\n- Fixes an issue that could prevent users from saving Dumbify wallpapers to their photo library.\\n\\nStay tuned for some awesome new features! :)\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-04-24\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-04-24T23:13:34Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- We've added some new default apps! These include: Camera, Clock, ChatGPT and Uber. More to come soon!\\n- Resolved a bug that could have potentially caused issues with custom apps.\\n- We've also updated the title and description when adding the Dumbify launcher widget to the home screen.\\n\\nWe hope you enjoy Dumbify as much as I love working on it! :)\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-04-17\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-04-17T00:10:46Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Fixes a bug on iOS 16 where the widget is not able to be added to home screen\\n- Fixes another bug where the background of widget does not blend properly on iOS 16\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-04-09\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-04-09T23:38:41Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Adds support for custom apps! This means that even if Dumbify doesn't have the exact app you are looking for, you can still add it yourself. We always take app requests and can add the apps you like.\\n- Adds support for iOS 16+ so more people can use Dumbify.\\n- UX improvements so it's easier to use Dumbify.\\n\\nWe hope you enjoy! :)\\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-04-08\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-04-08T17:00:08Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- We've added a way for users to submit app sugestions\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-04-03\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-04-03T00:38:42Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0\",\"releaseNotes\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2024-04-02\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-04-02T14:01:44Z\"}],\"isXROSCompatible\":false,\"minimumXROSVersion\":\"1.0\",\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=4990\u0026salableAdamId=6480082872\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=866316319\",\"type\":\"buy\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$4.99\",\"price\":4.99,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":34159616}]},{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=6480082872\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=866316319\",\"type\":\"update\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"p