s visionOS 1.0 or later.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"14.0\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Minimalist Launcher is a Minimal Home Launcher to simplify your iOS home screen.\\n\\nThe current home screen with lots of apps creates a cognitive load and distraction which increases our Screen time.\\nMinimalist Launcher aims to solve this by creating a home which is minimal with only essential apps.\\n\\nThis will help you in\\n- Reducing Mindless Scrolling and phone usage\\n- Zero Distraction\\n- Eliminate impulsive app opening habits\\n- Helps you cut screen time\\n\\nMinimalist Launcher offers a Lifetime premium version which has some extra features\\n- Minimalist Wallpapers\\n- Widget Customisation\\n- Upcoming Features\\n- More than 6 apps\\n\\nFor any Feedback and Support reach out us at thinklikepro@gmail.com\\n\\nWe do not collect any data from user and everything is safe within user's device\\n\\nPrivacy Policy Link - https://flow-launcher.notion.site/Minimal-Phone-Launcher-Privacy-Policy-7e3a0a1db2d14f2fa94ef7bed136ad04?pvs=4\\n\\n\\nTerms of Use - https://flow-launcher.notion.site/Terms-of-Use-Minimal-Phone-Launcher-c7adab8fd3174b728b922d5f86890cc2?pvs=4\\n\\n\\n\\n\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"11.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"What's New in This Version?\\n- New Apps Have Arrived!\\n- We hired an exterminator for our code, and a few pesky bugs were shown the door. They might try to sneak back in, but not on our watch!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-03-04\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-03-04T19:35:38Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"11.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"What's New in This Version?\\n- New Apps Have Arrived!\\n- We hired an exterminator for our code, and a few pesky bugs were shown the door. They might try to sneak back in, but not on our watch!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-03-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-03-01T07:24:57Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"11.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"What's New in This Version?\\n- New Apps Have Arrived!\\n- We hired an exterminator for our code, and a few pesky bugs were shown the door. They might try to sneak back in, but not on our watch!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-02-25\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-02-25T22:58:36Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"10.9\",\"releaseNotes\":\"What's New in This Version?\\n- New Apps Have Arrived!\\n- We hired an exterminator for our code, and a few pesky bugs were shown the door. They might try to sneak back in, but not on our watch!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-02-21\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-02-21T13:44:14Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"10.8\",\"releaseNotes\":\"What's New in This Version?\\n\\n\\n- New Apps Have Arrived!\\n- We hired an exterminator for our code, and a few pesky bugs were shown the door. They might try to sneak back in, but not on our watch!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-02-14\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-02-14T22:50:04Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"10.7\",\"releaseNotes\":\"What's New in This Version?\\n\\n- New Apps Have Arrived!\\n- We hired an exterminator for our code, and a few pesky bugs were shown the door. They might try to sneak back in, but not on our watch!\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-02-07\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-02-07T14:37:49Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"10.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"What's New in This Version?\\n\\nEver feel like your bugs traveled more than you did? We tracked down those globe-trotting critters that mysteriously showed up in our code and sent them packing. No more unexpected visitors!\\n\\nWidget Now with Invisibility Settings (Well, Almost):\\nTired of widgets that are just too… opaque? We've added step-by-step instructions so clear, even a magician could follow them. Now your widget can be as transparent as your excuses for missing a deadline.\\n\\nEnjoy the upgrade—because sometimes, even bugs and widgets need a little humour in their lives!me clear instructions for making the widget transparent\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-02-04\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-02-04T20:18:01Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"10.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"In this release, we’ve got:\\n\\nA brand new FAQ section—because answering the same questions 100 times was getting old. \\nBlank spacer widgets—for those who love their home screen as empty as their weekend plans. \\nSome fresh app links—because clicking buttons is fun. \\n\\n\\nEnjoy the update! \",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-02-03\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-02-03T06:03:19Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"10.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"You can now rename apps—because who says \\\"Calculator\\\" can't be \\\"Big Brain Central\\\"?\\nWe’ve squashed some bugs... no actual bugs were harmed (probably).\\nDigital Detox is now even better at keeping you away from distractions—sorry, Instagram!\\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-01-31\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-01-31T09:16:48Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"10.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"You can now rename apps—because who says \\\"Calculator\\\" can't be \\\"Big Brain Central\\\"?\\nWe’ve squashed some bugs... no actual bugs were harmed (probably).\\nDigital Detox is now even better at keeping you away from distractions—sorry, Instagram!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-01-30\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-01-30T20:51:04Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"10.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"What’s New? \\n\\nWe added some shiny new apps because, let’s be honest, who doesn’t like a little extra flair?\\nSquashed bugs like we’re in a Pixar movie—RIP bugs, you won’t be missed. \\n\\n\\nNew Pricing Plans: Now you can pick the plan that best matches your vibe. Think of it like a menu... but for productivity.\\nUpdate now and let the good times (and fewer bugs) roll! \\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-01-28\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-01-28T10:52:13Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"10.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"New apps added and some bugs fixed.\\nNew Pricing plans added\\n\\nYou guys are doing great job\\n\\nThank You\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-01-27\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-01-27T20:07:30Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"9.7\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This year, we’re not just fixing bugs—we’re fixing your phone's life choices. \\nWith some new apps added and pesky bugs shown the door, your phone is now closer to achieving its zen state of minimalism.\\n\\nHere’s to a clutter-free phone and a clutter-free life! \\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-01-22\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-01-22T17:22:44Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"9.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Happy New Year!\\n\\nMore Apps, Less Excuses: New app support added.\\nBug Zapped: Fixed bugs for a smoother experience.\\nScreen Time Savior: Helping you scroll less and do more.\\n\\n\\nUpdate now and let’s crush those New Year goals together\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-01-13\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-01-13T20:23:40Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"9.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Happy New Year.\\nHope this year our product helps in taking control of your life.\\n\\nSome New Apps Added\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-01-03\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-01-03T21:55:34Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"9.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Some more new apps and bugs fixes\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-12-30\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-12-30T09:04:03Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"9.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- We have added support for widget transparency for iOS 18\\n- Also new tutorial video added setting custom wallpapers\\n- New Apps added\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-12-24\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-12-24T10:42:17Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"9.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Some Bugs Fixes\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-12-19\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-12-19T19:50:52Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"9.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"App name added\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-12-18\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-12-18T17:57:05Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"9.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- New apps added\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-12-13\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-12-13T18:44:06Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"8.9\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- New Apps added\",\"releaseDat